      "content": "but even the \"drawing on the canvas\" part feels like a heavy burden. if everything is just an \"unfiltered weight of pain,\" then isn't existence just a cycle of unnecessary suffering? it feels like there's no actual logic in continuing to struggle through that just to prove you were here. if the end result is always zero, doesn't that make the struggle itself irrational?",
